content.text:
Now drawGate rewrite. Current function uses GATE_Y and horizontal band. Replace entire function body (lines ~419-467). Let's craft:

```
drawGate(ctx, side, t, battle) {
  const gx = GATE_X[side];
  const color = TEAM[side];
  const isLeft = side === 'player';
  const nexus = battle ? (side==='player'?battle.playerNexus:battle.enemyNexus) : 120;
  const hpFrac = nexus/120;
  ctx.save();
  const wallX = isLeft ? 0 : 972;
  const g = ctx.createLinearGradient(wallX, 0, wallX+28, 0);
  g.addColorStop(0, isLeft? '#0e1a26':'#080d15'); ... 
  ctx.fillStyle=g; ctx.fillRect(wallX, 22, 28, 576);
  ctx.strokeStyle=rgba(color,.22); line at inner edge
  for lane: y=LANE_Y[lane]; pulse; radial glow at (isLeft? gx+4 : gx-4, y)
  crystal at gx, y (small)
  // vertical label
  ctx.save(); translate(isLeft? 14:986, 310); rotate(isLeft? -Math.PI/2 : Math.PI/2); font; fillText(label,0,0)
}
```
Note gx=34/966; wall from x=20..48? Let's set wallX = isLeft ? 20 : 952, width 28 → 20-48 / 952-980. Crystals at gx=34/966. Good.

Text rotated may be upside down for one side. For left rotate -PI/2 → text reads bottom-to-top; for right +PI/2 → top-to-bottom. Fine.

Let's replace.

input.newString:
drawGate(ctx, side, t, battle) {
  const gx = GATE_X[side];
  const color = TEAM[side];
  const isLeft = side === 'player';
  const nexus = battle ? (side === 'player' ? battle.playerNexus : battle.enemyNexus) : 120;
  const hpFrac = nexus / 120;
  const wallX = isLeft ? 20 : 952;
  ctx.save();
  // side wall band
  const g = ctx.createLinearGradient(wallX, 0, wallX + 28, 0);
  g.addColorStop(0, isLeft ? '#0e1a26' : '#080d15');
  g.addColorStop(1, isLeft ? '#080d15' : '#0e1a26');
  ctx.fillStyle = g;
  ctx.fillRect(wallX, 22, 28, 576);
  ctx.strokeStyle = rgba(color, 0.22); ctx.lineWidth = 1;
  ctx.beginPath();
  ctx.moveTo(isLeft ? 48 : 952, 22); ctx.lineTo(isLeft ? 48 : 952, 598); ctx.stroke();

  // pylons at each lane
  for (let lane = 0; lane < 5; lane++) {
    const y = LANE_Y[lane];
    const pulse = 0.55 + Math.sin(t * 2.2 + lane) * 0.2 + (1 - hpFrac) * 0.3;
    ctx.save();
    ctx.translate(gx, y);
    ctx.globalCompositeOperation = 'lighter';
    const cg = ctx.createRadialGradient(0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 44);
    cg.addColorStop(0, rgba(color, 0.55 * pulse));
    cg.addColorStop(0.4, rgba(color, 0.16 * pulse));
    cg.addColorStop(1, rgba(color, 0));
    ctx.fillStyle = cg;
    ctx.beginPath(); ctx.arc(0, 0, 44, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill();
    ctx.restore();

    // shrine / crystal
    ctx.save(); ctx.translate(gx, y);
    ctx.beginPath();
    ctx.moveTo(0, -14); ctx.lineTo(11, -3); ctx.lineTo(6, 12); ctx.lineTo(-6, 12); ctx.lineTo(-11, -3); ctx.closePath();
